    description: "Scala: the _root_. prefix on a type name is not stripped before hashing, and SCALA_SHADOWED_JAVA_LANG omits StringBuilder.\n\nREPRO: def f(x: _root_.scala.collection.Seq[Int]) vs def f(x: scala.collection.Seq[Int]) hash apart. Separately, SCALA_SHADOWED_JAVA_LANG (feeds call-owner hints) lacks StringBuilder, which scala.StringBuilder shadows. Found by PR 5 agent 4 (stable-id v17 branch, 2026-11-20) while building WI-palus (type names hashed through the file's imports): ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr5/palus/RESULTS.md section 6; repros in pr5/palus/residual_probe/."  # 4100
